    "All11families independently viewed front/isometric/night. Same world scale exposes parameter changes. These public-command views use authored base material states; the separate13default material views use the reference finish pack.",
    "Continuous cliff surfaces no longer show the prior internal-face streaks. Rock size/split/wet appearance,tree height and juvenile crown proportions,drain openings and all four furniture widths are visible.",
